      "filename": "Thap Nhan Hindu temple, Tuy Hoa, Phu Yen province, Vietnam 15.jpg",
      "title": "File:Thap Nhan Hindu temple, Tuy Hoa, Phu Yen province, Vietnam 15.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e3/Thap_Nhan_Hindu_temple%2C_Tuy_Hoa%2C_Phu_Yen_province%2C_Vietnam_15.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
